    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Geraghty offer 26 Crestwood Road to the market, a 3 bedroom semidetached home with garage conversation, downstairs shower room and large laundry room, conveniently located, walking distance of local school (St Declan's), local shops, Ashbourne town centre, bus stops and essential services and amenities.This lovely semi has off street parking on the tarmacadam driveway, walled in front and rear gardens and a second reception room that will suit many uses, be it a home office, play room or chill space for older family members.The property is superbly located in the development and its proximity to all amenities will suit those seeking a home where convenience to everything is important.Viewing is strictly by prior appointment,\nFor transparency purposes, all bidding will be carried out on line via our unique bidding platform: \"MySherryFitz\""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nuPVC front door with double glazed side panels, laminate flooring, under stairs storage and radiator cover\n\nSitting Room - \nLaminate flooring cast iron fireplace, tiled insert with hardwood surround, (open fire) double doors to dining\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - \nFitted with base and eye level storage cupboards, having integrated dishwasher, tiled floor and French doors to garden from dining room area\n\nUtility Room / Laundry Room - \nThis very spacious area has storage cupboards, is plumbed for utilities, has an exit door and the gas boiler is housed here\n\nShower Room - \nFully tiled, Triton power shower, space saving vanity basin, towel radiator, Velux window\n\nReception Room - \nSuti many uses, having laminate flooring underfoot\n\nUpstairs - \nCarpet stairs and landing area with access to attic (tongue and groove flooring upstairs, covered)\n\nAirng Cupboard - \nShelved for optimum use\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled, window for natural light and ventilation\n\nBedroom 1 - \nLocated at the rear of the residence, having built in wardrobes and laminate flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - \nThis double bedroom is located at the front , has built in wardrobes with vanity area and drawer section\n\nBedroom 3 - \nAlso at the front, with feature wall panelling and laminate flooring\n\nOutdoors - \nWalled front gardenTarmacadam drivewayWalled rea gardenPaved patioGarden shed with path to sameOutdoor tap\n\nIncluded in Sale - \nCarpets, window dressings, oven, hob, extractor fan, integrated dishwasher and garden shed\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Walled front garden, walled rear garden</li><li>Off street parking - tarmacadam driveway</li><li>Walking distance local National school - St Declan's, and local shops in Garden City Development</li><li>Secondary schools close by</li><li>Short walk to bus stops and Ashbourne town centre</li><li>Shower room downstairs</li><li>Large laundry room / utility room</li><li>Mains services, GFCH</ul>"
      },
